# ===================================
# Instructions for Setup:
# ===================================

# 1. Database Setup:
#    SQLite database file will be created automatically on first run.
#    No manual database setup required!

# 2. Generate JWT_SECRET:
#    openssl rand -hex 32

# 3. Generate ENCRYPTION_KEY:
#    python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())"

# 4. Install dependencies:
#    pip install sqlalchemy uvicorn fastapi pydantic-settings python-jose passlib bcrypt cryptography httpx python-dotenv python-multipart

# 5. Set up GitHub OAuth:
#    - Go to https://github.com/settings/developers
#    - Click "New OAuth App"
#    - Application name: AutoPM
#    - Homepage URL: http://localhost:5173
#    - Authorization callback URL: http://localhost:5173/callback/github
#    - Copy Client ID and Client Secret

# 6. Set up Jira OAuth:
#    - Go to https://developer.atlassian.com/console/myapps/
#    - Create a new OAuth 2.0 app
#    - Add callback URL: http://localhost:5173/callback/jira
#    - Configure permissions: read:jira-user, read:jira-work, write:jira-work, offline_access
#    - Copy Client ID and Client Secret

# 7. Run the application:
#    uvicorn main:app --reload
